{"continue":{"iistart":"2025-10-11T11:25:41Z","continue":"||"},"query":{"pages":{"176516526":{"pageid":176516526,"ns":6,"title":"File:Joseph Stalin official portrait.jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg/1280px-Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1000,"thumbheight":1350,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg/1280px-Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1000,"height":1350,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Joseph_Stalin_official_portrait.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=176516526","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-10-12 08:17:46","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Joseph Stalin official portrait","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD-Russia-1996|Images with extracted images|Media from the Russian Ministry of Defence|Portrait photographs of Joseph Stalin|Joseph Stalin in 1945|Photos by Ivan Shagin|Communist symbols|Copyrighted in Germany","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"An official portrait of Soviet Premier Josef Stalin is issued to commemorate his 70th birthday on Dec. 21, 1949.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1945","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tassphoto.com/ru/asset/fullTextSearch/search/%D0%B8%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%84+%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BD/page/1/sorting/oldest\">TASS Mediabank</a> (ID 32389768)\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://historynetwork.ru/images/persons/202212/C42B93FF-9CC2-49D8-9BA2-181D786C1BFB.jpg\">High quality web publication</a>\n</p><p>21 December 1949:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.sb.by/articles/rovno-74-goda-nazad-21-dekabrya-1949-goda-sb-rasskazala-o-posledney-v-zhizni-iosifa-stalina-nagrade.html\">Sovetskaya Belorussia</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://100.iz.ru/Gallery?gallery_id=9059\">Preparation of the Bolshoi Theater Hall for a solemn meeting on the occasion of the 70th anniversary of Joseph Stalin</a></li></ul>\n<p>4 October 1952:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://auction.ru/offer/sssr_literaturnaja_gazeta_4_oktjabrja_1952_g_k_otkrytiju_xix_sezda_vkp_b_privet_partii_lenina_stalina-i122661531197687.html?utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_source=yandexsmartcamera\">Literaturnaya Gazeta</a></li></ul>\n<p>On 6-7 March 1953 it was published anonymously in many newspapers, for example <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://oldgravura.ru/prod/stalin--i12188/\">Pravda</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://oldgravura.ru/prod/stalin--i12188/\">Leningradskaya Pravda</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.farpost.ru/vladivostok/hobby/antiques/antiques/gazeta-boevaja-vahta-smert-stalina-7-marta-1953-god-vladivostok-kpz-64656164.html\">Boevaya Vakhta</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://stancoy.livejournal.com/79423.html?utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_source=yandexsmartcamera\">Molodoy Stalinets</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://agambler.ru/sport/s1-00012159?utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_source=yandexsmartcamera\">Molot</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://auction.ru/offer/gazeta_volzhskaja_kommuna_6_marta_1953_god_kujbyshev_soobshchenie_o_smerti_stalina-i99645037654358.html?utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_source=yandexsmartcamera\">Volzhskaya Kommuna</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://meshok.net/item/333462611_%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D1%8B%D0%BC%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B4%D0%B0_6_%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B0_1953_%D0%B3_%D0%A1%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D1%8C_%D0%A1%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0\">Krymskaya Pravda</a>\n</p><p>Also it was published in <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://vatnikstan.ru/history/smert-stalina-v-sovetskoy-presse/\">Ogonyok magazine</a>, \u2116 10, 1953.\n</p><p>The author indicated in <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tass.ru/encyclopedia/person/stalin-iosif-vissarionovich\">Biography of Stalin in the TASS encyclopedia</a>.\n</p><p>This <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://rodina-history.ru/2023/02/14/reg-cfo/traurnyj-portret-stalina-prodadut-s-molotka.html\">funeral portrait</a> was sent by special mail to the newspaper offices to publish the pictures. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://meshok.net/item/58716352_%D0%A4%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0_%D0%A2%D0%90%D0%A1%D0%A1_Generalissimo\">[1]</a> \n</p>\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mil.ru/ministry/history/ministers/2f2fbef7-0088-4ca0-bc83-611344ba33aa\">MIL.RU PUBLICATION</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4519310\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q4519310\"><span title=\"Soviet photojournalist (1904\u20131982)\">Ivan Shagin</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table style=\"width:100%; clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; border-spacing:8px; background-color:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f7f8ff); border:2px solid #8888aa;color: inherit;\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"layouttemplate restrictiontemplate restriction-communist\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:none; width:64px;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Non-copyright_restrictions\" title=\"Communist symbol\"><img alt=\"Communist symbol\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Under_section_sign%2C_hammer_and_sickle.svg/120px-Under_section_sign%2C_hammer_and_sickle.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"77\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Under_section_sign%2C_hammer_and_sickle.svg/250px-Under_section_sign%2C_hammer_and_sickle.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"384\" data-file-height=\"460\"></a><figcaption>Communist symbol</figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:120%\"><b> Legal disclaimer </b></span><br><b>This image contains a symbol <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Bans_on_communist_symbols\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Bans on communist symbols\">prohibited</a> by law in some nations</b>, owing to it being a representation of <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Communism\" title=\"Category:Communism\">communism</a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Socialism\" title=\"Category:Socialism\">socialism</a>, or a similar governmental structure; or of an associated <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Political_parties\" title=\"Category:Political parties\">political party</a>/organization:\n<ul><li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Georgia_(country)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Georgia (country)\">Georgia</a>'s <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Parliament_of_Georgia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Parliament of Georgia\">parliament</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://matsne.gov.ge/ka/document/view/2167706?publication=0\">On Amending the Law of Georgia \"Charter of Liberty\", No. 1867, 2013</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Indonesia\" title=\"Indonesia\">Indonesia</a>'s <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:People%27s_Consultative_Assembly\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:People's Consultative Assembly\">People's Consultative Assembly</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://peraturan.bpk.go.id/Home/Details/45342/uu-no-27-tahun-1999\">UU No. 27/1999</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Latvia\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Latvia\">Latvia</a>'s <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saeima\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saeima\">Saeima</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://likumi.lv/ta/id/258037-grozijumi-publisku-izklaides-un-svetku-pasakumu-drosibas-likuma\">Amendments to the Law on the Safety of Public Entertainment and Festivity Events (OP 2013/129.4)</a>. Ban only applies at public events.</li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Lithuania\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lithuania\">Lithuania</a>'s <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Constitutional_Court_of_Lithuania\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Constitutional Court of Lithuania\">Constitutional Court</a> confirms Article 188<sup>18</sup> of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://europam.eu/data/mechanisms/PF/PF%20Laws/Lithuania/Lithuania_Code%20of%20administrative%20offences_1985_amended2016_eng.pdf\">Code of Administrative Offences</a>. Collection, antiquarian trade and educational activities are exempt from the ban.</li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/South_Korea\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"South Korea\">South Korea</a>'s <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.law.go.kr/%EB%B2%95%EB%A0%B9/%EA%B5%AD%EA%B0%80%EB%B3%B4%EC%95%88%EB%B2%95\">National Security Act</a> (prohibited for symbols or emblems related to North Korea)</li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ukraine\">Ukraine</a>'s <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verkhovna_Rada\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Verkhovna Rada\">Verkhovna Rada</a> (article 436-1 of  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://zakon4.rada.gov.ua/laws/show/2341-14/page19\">the Criminal code of Ukraine</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>Imagery covered may include the <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Hammer_and_sickle\" title=\"Category:Hammer and sickle\">hammer and sickle</a><sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Hammer_and_sickle#Legal_status\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Hammer and sickle\">en</a></sup>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Red_star\" title=\"Red star\">red star</a>, emblems/insignias, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Flags\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flags\">flags</a> or images of leaders.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:small;line-height:1.4\" class=\"plainlinks noprint\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/ar\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/ar\"><bdi class=\"language lang-ar\" lang=\"ar\">\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/be\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/be\"><bdi class=\"language lang-be\" lang=\"be\">\u0431\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0441\u043a\u0430\u044f</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/be-tarask\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/be-tarask\"><bdi class=\"language lang-be-tarask\" lang=\"be-tarask\">\u0431\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0441\u043a\u0430\u044f (\u0442\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0448\u043a\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0446\u0430)</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/be-x-old\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/be-x-old\"><bdi class=\"language lang-be-x-old\" lang=\"be-x-old\">\u0431\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0441\u043a\u0430\u044f (\u0442\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0448\u043a\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0446\u0430)</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/bg\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/bg\"><bdi class=\"language lang-bg\" lang=\"bg\">\u0431\u044a\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0441\u043a\u0438</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/cs\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/cs\"><bdi class=\"language lang-cs\" lang=\"cs\">\u010de\u0161tina</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/da\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/da\"><bdi class=\"language lang-da\" lang=\"da\">dansk</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/de\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/de\"><bdi class=\"language lang-de\" lang=\"de\">Deutsch</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/en\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/en\"><bdi class=\"language lang-en\" lang=\"en\">English</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/eo\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/eo\"><bdi class=\"language lang-eo\" lang=\"eo\">Esperanto</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/es\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/es\"><bdi class=\"language lang-es\" lang=\"es\">espa\u00f1ol</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/eu\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/eu\"><bdi class=\"language lang-eu\" lang=\"eu\">euskara</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/fi\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/fi\"><bdi class=\"language lang-fi\" lang=\"fi\">suomi</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/fr\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/fr\"><bdi class=\"language lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">fran\u00e7ais</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/gd\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/gd\"><bdi class=\"language lang-gd\" lang=\"gd\">G\u00e0idhlig</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/gl\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/gl\"><bdi class=\"language lang-gl\" lang=\"gl\">galego</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/hi\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/hi\"><bdi class=\"language lang-hi\" lang=\"hi\">\u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/hu\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/hu\"><bdi class=\"language lang-hu\" lang=\"hu\">magyar</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/id\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/id\"><bdi class=\"language lang-id\" lang=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/it\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/it\"><bdi class=\"language lang-it\" lang=\"it\">italiano</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/ja\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/ja\"><bdi class=\"language lang-ja\" lang=\"ja\">\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e</bdi></a>\u00a0<b>\u2219</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/jax\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Communist_symbol/jax\"><bdi class=\"language lang-jax\" lang=\"jax\">Bahaso Jambi</bdi></a>